---
import Container from "../../components/ui/Container.astro";
import SectionTitle from "../../components/ui/SectionTitle.astro";
---

<section id="faq" class="py-28 lg:py-36 bg-cotton">
  <Container maxWidth="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="reveal">
      <SectionTitle
        label="FAQ"
        title="Common questions from our buyers"
      />
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-14 divide-y divide-black/10 border-y border-black/10"
      id="faq-list"
    >
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >Which products do you supply?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We manufacture premium cotton bales and trade maize, pulses (Toor
            Dal, Chana, Moong, Urad, Masoor) and food grains including wheat,
            rice, sorghum and millets.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >What is your minimum order quantity (MOQ)?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            MOQ varies by product and grade. Share your requirement through
            our contact form and we will confirm quantities and lead time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >How is packaging handled?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Packaging is arranged according to the mode of transport and the
            destination, following standard commercial practice for bulk
            agricultural commodities.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >How is pricing determined?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Pricing depends on product, grade, quantity and delivery terms.
            Request a quote and we will respond with a detailed breakdown.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >What quality checks do you follow?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Every batch is sourced from vetted regions, graded before dispatch
            and stored under controlled conditions to preserve quality.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >What are your typical payment terms?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Payment terms are agreed on a per-order basis during negotiation,
            in line with standard commercial trade practice.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >What is the typical lead time?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Lead time depends on product, quantity and season. We confirm a
            realistic schedule once the order is finalized.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >What documentation do you provide?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We prepare commercial documentation appropriate to each order and
            destination, coordinated with the buyer's requirements.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item py-2">
        <button
          class="faq-q w-full text-left py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span class="font-display text-lg text-deep"
            >Do you take international inquiries?</span
          >
          <span class="faq-icon text-gold text-xl">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p class="pb-5 text-ink/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes. We are actively expanding internationally and welcome
            inquiries from buyers, importers and distributors worldwide.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
